 "equipment_type": "Variable frequency drive",
 "applies_to": "All GS3 drives; status addresses and P9.xx serial-communication parameters from chapter 5 of the user manual.",
 "summary": "The GS3 is an AutomationDirect AC drive with a built-in RS-485 port running Modbus ASCII or RTU. Drive parameters P0.00-P9.xx map to holding registers (parameter group x 256 + number), and read-only status registers at 2100h report fault code, run state, frequencies, voltages and load. This map covers the status block and the P9 serial control parameters used to run the drive over Modbus.",
